{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing idle desktop companion where a fox keeps your campfire alive and cooks treats as you type. Earn marshmallow coins, unlock upgrades, and decorate a lakeside campsite with gentle, zero-stress progress that fits alongside work or relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/ff4a086112112704899eb2413d667a8d.poster.avif?t=1756753169\" width=358 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/ff4a086112112704899eb2413d667a8d.webm?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/ff4a086112112704899eb2413d667a8d.mp4?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set it running and let the fox gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows while you work or relax. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/cc7f59162b30e78f3bb6e3f7337308f9.poster.avif?t=1756753169\" width=358 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/cc7f59162b30e78f3bb6e3f7337308f9.webm?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/cc7f59162b30e78f3bb6e3f7337308f9.mp4?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game runs in a transparent overlay, so you never have to alt-tab. When you\u2019re active on PC, production speeds up, and when you\u2019re away, the fox settles into a deep idle to relax with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Overlay Companion</strong><br>Watch your fox gather logs, stoke the flames, and cook treats in a scalable, transparent overlay on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activity-Responsive Loop</strong><br>Typing and clicks encourage the fox to move and cook. Low activity shifts to a relaxed deep-idle state with a small passive income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/6fd438367bd537c39c542e358ea831ea.poster.avif?t=1756753169\" width=364 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/6fd438367bd537c39c542e358ea831ea.webm?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/6fd438367bd537c39c542e358ea831ea.mp4?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins &amp; Upgrades</strong> <br>Collect and spend marshmallow coins to boost carry amount, cooking speed, campfire capacity, and coin yield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decoration Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your shelter, hearth style, trees, firewood, and outfit. Unlock new variants and earn small, category bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, Zero-Stress</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gameplay</strong><br>No fail states or timers to chase, just soft ambience, gentle animations, and steady, satisfying progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campfire Audio</strong><br>Gentle crackles, clinks, and a calm soundtrack that helps you to concentrate or relax.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954800?t=1756753169","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954800?t=1756753169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/0a4fa7aec688c804c09f709eff909517914178eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756753169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/0a4fa7aec688c804c09f709eff909517914178eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756753169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing idle desktop companion where a fox keeps your campfire alive and cooks treats as you type. Earn marshmallow coins, unlock upgrades, and decorate a lakeside campsite with gentle, zero-stress progress that fits alongside work or relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/ff4a086112112704899eb2413d667a8d.poster.avif?t=1756753169\" width=358 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/ff4a086112112704899eb2413d667a8d.webm?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/ff4a086112112704899eb2413d667a8d.mp4?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set it running and let the fox gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows while you work or relax. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/cc7f59162b30e78f3bb6e3f7337308f9.poster.avif?t=1756753169\" width=358 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/cc7f59162b30e78f3bb6e3f7337308f9.webm?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/cc7f59162b30e78f3bb6e3f7337308f9.mp4?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game runs in a transparent overlay, so you never have to alt-tab. When you\u2019re active on PC, production speeds up, and when you\u2019re away, the fox settles into a deep idle to relax with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Desktop Overlay Companion</strong><br>Watch your fox gather logs, stoke the flames, and cook treats in a scalable, transparent overlay on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Activity-Responsive Loop</strong><br>Typing and clicks encourage the fox to move and cook. Low activity shifts to a relaxed deep-idle state with a small passive income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/6fd438367bd537c39c542e358ea831ea.poster.avif?t=1756753169\" width=364 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/6fd438367bd537c39c542e358ea831ea.webm?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/6fd438367bd537c39c542e358ea831ea.mp4?t=1756753169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coins &amp; Upgrades</strong> <br>Collect and spend marshmallow coins to boost carry amount, cooking speed, campfire capacity, and coin yield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decoration Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your shelter, hearth style, trees, firewood, and outfit. Unlock new variants and earn small, category bonuses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, Zero-Stress</strong>\u00a0<strong>Gameplay</strong><br>No fail states or timers to chase, just soft ambience, gentle animations, and steady, satisfying progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campfire Audio</strong><br>Gentle crackles, clinks, and a calm soundtrack that helps you to concentrate or relax.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Anton Weissberg"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/28b9815c27a2b973de40058eedacfa6331c4df61/header.jpg?t=1756753169","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191480,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191480/movie480.mp4?t=1756685794","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191480/movie_max.mp4?t=1756685794"},"name":"Campfire Harmony Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191480/918c77f77d7e0ec6b2310e8c2fd15933fefcface/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756685794","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191480/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756685794","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191480/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756685794"}}],"name":"Campfire Harmony","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3 @ 2.00 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel\u00ae HD Graphics 5500<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":